&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with game development, cloud platforms, DevOps, and CI/CD pipelines is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
