&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a transformative Senior Director, Talent Acquisition to lead the overall recruiting function and deliver a high-impact, modern, and scalable hiring experience across the organization. In this role, the successful candidate will partner closely with senior business leaders and HR stakeholders to align hiring priorities, shape workforce plans, and support business growth through innovative, data-driven talent strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;This leader will oversee end-to-end recruitment strategy and operations, guide team performance, and drive process improvements that strengthen hiring outcomes, scalability, speed, and quality of hire. A key focus of the role will be leading the successful implementation and optimization of Workday Recruiting and related processes, while advancing the use of AI-enabled recruiting tools, automation, talent intelligence, and analytics to improve sourcing effectiveness, decision quality, operational efficiency, and candidate experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The ideal candidate is an AI-forward talent acquisition leader who brings strong leadership, stakeholder management, strategic thinking, and communication skills, along with deep expertise in recruiting operations, team development, talent analytics, recruiting technology, and enterprise process transformation. They will bring experience leading large-scale systems and process change, including Workday implementation or optimization, as well as a thoughtful approach to the responsible use of AI and technology across the hiring lifecycle. They will also bring a fresh and creative approach to attracting top talent and play a key role in advancing and strengthening our employer brand in the market.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead the global Talent Acquisition function across a broad team or portfolio, with accountability for recruiting strategy, delivery, team capability, technology adoption, and performance against hiring goals.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner closely with senior business leaders, HRBPs, budget stakeholders, and People Technology partners to align workforce plans, headcount priorities, and hiring strategy with business needs, using market intelligence and talent data to inform decisions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead the implementation, optimization, and adoption of Workday Recruiting and related workflows, ensuring processes are scalable, efficient, and aligned to business and candidate needs.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Oversee end-to-end recruitment execution across roles and regions, ensuring strong delivery from requisition creation and job posting through screening, interviewing, offers, preboarding, and onboarding handoff.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Define and evolve an AI-enabled sourcing and recruiting strategy by leveraging automation, talent intelligence platforms, market mapping tools, and predictive insights to build stronger pipelines and improve speed to hire.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive recruiting effectiveness through process standardization, workflow redesign, ATS optimization, pipeline analytics, workflow automation, and continuous improvement of how the Talent Acquisition function scales and delivers results.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Evaluate, implement, and optimize emerging recruiting technologies, including AI tools that support sourcing, screening, scheduling, reporting, and recruiter productivity.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Establish and track metrics that measure both efficiency and effectiveness, including time to fill, funnel health, recruiter capacity, candidate experience, hiring manager satisfaction, quality of hire, and adoption of key recruiting technologies and workflows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Establish clear standards for the responsible and ethical use of AI in hiring, with appropriate attention to fairness, transparency, compliance, data quality, and human decision-making.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead change management efforts tied to recruiting process transformation, ensuring strong stakeholder alignment, user adoption, training, and operational readiness across recruiters, hiring managers, and cross-functional partners.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Coach and develop recruiters and TA leaders to build capability in consultative partnership, data literacy, AI fluency, and modern talent acquisition practices.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Experience / Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;10+ years of experience leading talent acquisition across a broad team, function, or portfolio, with accountability for hiring delivery, capability building, and performance against recruiting goals.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong leadership and business partnering skills, with the ability to work closely with senior business leaders, HRBPs, budget stakeholders, and cross-functional partners to align hiring priorities, workforce plans, and recruiting strategy.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Deep understanding of the end-to-end recruitment lifecycle, including requisition creation, job posting, sourcing, screening, interviewing, offers, preboarding, and onboarding handoff.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Demonstrated experience leading the implementation, optimization, or transformation of recruiting technology, ideally including Workday Recruiting or a comparable enterprise ATS.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience evaluating and implementing emerging AI solutions and recruiting technologies in a way that improves both efficiency and quality without compromising candidate experience, hiring rigor, or compliance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Demonstrated experience using AI-enabled recruiting tools, automation, talent data, and recruiting technologies to improve sourcing effectiveness, recruiter productivity, operational efficiency, decision quality, and hiring outcomes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong market awareness and strategic judgment, with the ability to guide sourcing strategy, share talent insights, and support informed hiring decisions in a competitive environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong knowledge of recruiting best practices, including structured screening, inclusive interviewing, and delivering a high-quality candidate and hiring manager experience across the hiring process.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong analytical capability, with experience defining success metrics and using data to drive continuous improvement across recruiting performance, quality of hire, operational outcomes, and technology adoption.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience leading change management, process redesign, stakeholder adoption, and operational enablement in support of recruiting transformation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Understanding of responsible AI principles and the ability to balance innovation with sound judgment, compliance, and equitable hiring practices.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent communication skills, strategic thinking, and operational discipline, with the ability to lead change and influence stakeholders across the organization.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Workday Recruiting and related Workday tools, including implementation support, reporting, workflow optimization, user adoption, governance, and process enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Diligent is the AI leader in governance, risk and compliance (GRC) SaaS solutions, helping more than 1 million users and 700,000 board members to clarify risk and elevate governance. The Diligent One Platform gives practitioners, the C-Suite and the board a consolidated view of their entire GRC practice so they can more effectively manage risk, build greater resilience and make better decisions, faster.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At Diligent, we&#39;re building the future with people who think boldly and move fast. &amp;nbsp;Whether you&#39;re designing systems that leverage large language models or part of a team reimaging workflows with AI, you&#39;ll help us unlock entirely new ways of working and thinking. &amp;nbsp;Curiosity is in our DNA, we look for individuals willing to ask the big questions and experiment fearlessly - those who embrace change not as a challenge, but as an opportunity. &amp;nbsp;The future belongs to those who keep learning, and we are building it together. &amp;nbsp;At Diligent, you’re not just building the future - you’re an agent of positive change, joining a global community on a mission to make an impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;diligent.com or follow us on&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA170dad44-6a69-e1e1-d720-601cd59ec77c&quot; class=&quot;x_x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/diligent-board-member-services/mycompany/verification/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;c606bc91-5052-4d3a-a1d1-ed00ede365d9&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA153deb8c-7641-f6fc-97cb-65df680002a3&quot; class=&quot;x_x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/DiligentCorporation/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;07f4e461-6294-4482-a624-e58c27cd6199&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;2&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Diligent Offers You&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creativity is ingrained in our culture.&lt;/strong&gt; We are innovative collaborators by nature. We thrive in exploring how things can be differently both in our internal processes and to help our clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We care about our people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Diligent offers a flexible work environment, global days of service, comprehensive health benefits, meeting free days, generous time off policy and wellness programs&amp;nbsp;to name a few&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have teams all over the world&lt;/strong&gt;. We may be headquartered in New York City, but we have office hubs in Washington D.C., Vancouver, London, Galway, Budapest, Munich, Bengaluru, Singapore, and Sydney.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity is important to us.&lt;/strong&gt; Growing, maintaining and promoting a diverse team is a top priority for us. We foster and encourage diversity through our Employee Resource Groups and provide access to resources and education to support the education of our team, facilitate dialogue, and foster understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diligent created the modern governance movement. Our world-changing idea is to empower leaders with the technology, insights and connections they need to drive greater impact and accountability – to lead with purpose. Our employees are passionate, smart, and creative people who not only want to help build the software company of the future, but who want to make the world a more sustainable, equitable and better place.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in New York, Diligent has offices in Washington D.C.,&amp;nbsp; London, Galway, Budapest, Vancouver, Bengaluru, Munich, Singapore and Sydney.  &amp;nbsp;To foster strong collaboration and connection, this role will follow a hybrid work model. If you are within a commuting distance to one of our Diligent office locations, you will be expected to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;work onsite at least 50% of the time.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe that in-person engagement helps drive innovation, teamwork, and a strong sense of community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Diligent is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based on race, color, religious creed, sex, national origin, ancestry, citizenship status, pregnancy, childbirth, physical disability, mental disability, age, military status, protected veteran status, marital status, registered domestic partner or civil union status, gender (including sex stereotyping and gender identity or expression), medical condition (including, but not limited to, cancer related or HIV/AIDS related), genetic information, or sexual orientation in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws.&amp;nbsp;We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. See also&amp;nbsp;Diligent&#39;s&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/company/eeo-policy&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;5e90c823-c220-4ada-92af-0b9df69068d6&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;4&quot;&gt;EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/-/media/project/diligent/master/eeo-is-the-law-poster-eeocselfprintposter-and-ofccp-supplement-from-20170719.pdf?rev=96fafda8-f51d-44b6-a380-9af42898f526&amp;amp;hash=614AE342F4AB51A091EA3E15F84F7E49&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;25527b37-a96e-4ef3-af1f-248e2a881a45&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;5&quot;&gt;US EEOC&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/-/media/project/diligent/master/eeo-is-the-law-poster-eeocselfprintposter-and-ofccp-supplement-from-20170719.pdf?rev=96fafda8-f51d-44b6-a380-9af42898f526&amp;amp;hash=614AE342F4AB51A091EA3E15F84F7E49&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;25527b37-a96e-4ef3-af1f-248e2a881a45&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;6&quot;&gt;’&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/-/media/project/diligent/master/eeo-is-the-law-poster-eeocselfprintposter-and-ofccp-supplement-from-20170719.pdf?rev=96fafda8-f51d-44b6-a380-9af42898f526&amp;amp;hash=614AE342F4AB51A091EA3E15F84F7E49&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;25527b37-a96e-4ef3-af1f-248e2a881a45&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;7&quot;&gt;s Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;. We are a drug free workplace.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities and disabled veterans in our job application procedures. If you need assistance or an accommodation due to a disability, you may contact us at -----
&lt;div&gt;To support a fair and consistent hiring&amp;nbsp;process, we use AI&amp;nbsp;and digital automated tools to assist our recruitment team in organizing candidate data, surfacing relevant applications, coordinating&amp;nbsp;interview scheduling and summarizing interview notes. All final screening, evaluation, and hiring decisions are made by humans on our team. To learn more about how we collect, protect, and process your information, please review our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/legal/candidate-privacy&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;48c7a45d-2b3c-4bc9-99ec-639351abe71c&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Diligent, we recognize the value of a diverse global workforce. Visa sponsorship may be available for select positions based on business needs and specific role requirements. Sponsorship decisions are evaluated on a case-by-case basis, and eligibility should not be assumed for all opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment agencies:&lt;/strong&gt; Diligent does not accept unsolicited agency resumes. Please do not forward resumes to our jobs alias, Diligent employees or any other organization location. Diligent is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ocado Group is an equal opportunities employer and as such makes every effort to ensure that all potential employees are treated fairly and equally, regardless of their sex, sexual orientation, marital status, race, colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin, religion or belief, age, or disability or union membership status.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams are putting the world’s retailers online using the cloud, robotics, AI, and IoT. We provide services to partner clients globally via our innovative advanced robotics technology, known as the Ocado Smart Platform (&quot;OSP&quot;), this drives our highly automated, multi-million pound Customer Fulfilment Centres (CFCs). In our CFCs - together with the proprietary software applications - we operate a world-class online grocery business that automates the single pick of products, ready for your online delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Legal Counsel, you will deliver high-quality legal advice on commercial, procurement, and transactional matters across Ocado Group, both in the UK and internationally, while mentoring junior team members.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will navigate complex commercial, procurement, and technology law at pace, actively contributing to the team’s broader functional strategy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Naturally collaborative, you will build strong, trusted partnerships at all levels of our growing business to enable Ocado’s sustainable expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accountabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working collaboratively with senior stakeholders across the Business up to the Executive Director level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drafting, negotiating and providing expert advice on a wide range of domestic and cross border general commercial work in respect of technology and software including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;technology and hardware procurement arrangements including supply and/or manufacture agreements;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IT procurement including appointment of cloud service providers, SaaS and IT licences;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IP matters including collaboration agreements, licensing and cross-licensing;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;data protection matters including data protection agreements and advice; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;logistics and distribution agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drafting, negotiating and providing expert advice on new and existing Ocado Solution Platform customer contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support on construction, engineering and product delivery arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring compliance with corporate governance (including competition/antitrust policies) as part of any negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipating, identifying and advising on disputes, employment, corporate and financing issues in the context of commercial contracts and working collaboratively with the Disputes, Employment and Corporate Legal team on relevant matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipating, identifying and advising on IP, competition and data protection issues in the context of commercial contracts and working collaboratively with the Compliance and Regulatory team on relevant matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading on the commercial legal aspects of key projects, including corporate and capital markets transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates a pragmatic and customer focussed approach to risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaising and managing external counsel effectively from a delivery, risk and cost perspective on a daily basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to the development of the legal team’s strategy and proactively maintaining and raising the profile of the&amp;nbsp; team by developing and taking forward team initiatives/objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and providing training and legal updates to the business on various areas of the law and regulatory matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing Ocado standard contract templates and know-how materials.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualified solicitor or barrister with specialism in commercial contracts / transactions of 4 years or more PQE (although candidates outside this range who can demonstrate their ability to perform the duties of the role will still be considered).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally will have trained with a leading law firm or in-house team with a particular focus on commercial and technology transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising on commercial and technology law outside of the UK, with a desire to develop and expand on expertise in this area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience of working with senior management including at executive level and operating with broad latitude in complex environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth experience of domestic and cross border transactional&amp;nbsp; drafting, negotiating, and advising on a wide variety of commercial contracts in respect of technology investments, engineering and IT procurement, design, manufacture, supply and licensing including master service agreements, collaboration agreements, general terms and conditions, SaaS subscription agreements, logistics &amp;amp; distribution agreements and e-commerce agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong academic qualifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred (in addition to minimum):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of working with technology contracts and organisations would be valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-house experience within a fast-paced, commercial environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of corporate, capital markets and M&amp;amp;A transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our employee benefits are designed for you, we care about people and we’ve ensured we have a wealth of benefits that focus on your well-being. We regularly review our benefits to ensure we are supporting our employees appropriately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days ‘working from anywhere in the world’ policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing support through dedicated apps and an Employee Assistance Programme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days annual leave, rising to 27 days after 5 years service (plus optional holiday purchase)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension scheme (various options available including employer contribution matching up to 7%)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Private Medical Insurance (within the first month of joining!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Income Protection (can be up to 50% of salary for 3 years) and Life Assurance (3 x annual salary)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;22 weeks paid maternity leave and 6 weeks paid paternity leave (once relevant service requirements complete)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train Ticket loan (interest-free)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free shuttle bus to and from Hatfield Train Station to the Hatfield offices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free shuttle bus to and from Welwyn Garden City Train Station to the Welwyn Garden City offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to participate in Sharesave and Buy as You Earn share schemes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15% discount on Ocado.com and free delivery for all employees (within the first month of joining!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
