&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our clients in Worldwide Activation are split into 4 specialist category hubs, this role will sit within the entertainment hub working on Audible&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Precision Manager role is perfect for an experienced, enthusiastic, and creative person with strong organisational skills who loves entertainment and movies. The role gives a unique opportunity to innovate and progress your knowledge about international digital media across channels and markets while being supported by the Precision Lead.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
