&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This role is within The Goat Agency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;, a leading brand within WPP Media, where you will be instrumental in &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW64445132 BCX4&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64445132 BCX4&quot;&gt;helping global brands harness the power of social and creator-led content to deliver measurable impact. Recognised as a global leader in the space, we deliver award-winning campaigns in more than 70 countries. With over 650 social natives worldwide, we create ambitious influencer programmes from tactical activations to long-term partnerships, designed to drive awareness,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64445132 BCX4&quot;&gt;engagement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64445132 BCX4&quot;&gt;and conversions across the full marketing funnel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW64445132 BCX4&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Role Overview:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Senior Delivery Director is a high-impact, agile role within the Global Campaign Delivery department. This role is designed to drive operational excellence, quality assurance, and seamless execution across all global markets, where required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This individual will be a deployable global asset, stepping in to support, guide, and optimise delivery across all core disciplines: Organic (campaign operations, social media management), Paid Media/Programmatic, and Production. Operating with a high degree of flexibility, they will split their time between steering campaign excellence for our highest-value (Platinum and Gold) clients, supporting global new business efforts, and aligning/optimising ways of working across regional delivery teams.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;1. Global Deployment &amp;amp; Client Excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Value Account Stewardship:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the senior delivery lead and strategic troubleshooter on key Platinum and Gold client campaigns globally, ensuring flawless execution, risk mitigation, and the realisation of guaranteed deliverables across multiple models.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Resource Deployment:&lt;/strong&gt; Rapidly deploy across different markets, client accounts, or departments (Organic, Paid, Production, Social) based on business needs, workload surges, or delivery challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unrestricted, Hands-on Support:&lt;/strong&gt; When assigned to a client, involvement is completely unrestricted. This role requires a &quot;roll-up-your-sleeves&quot; approach; you must be willing and able to execute hands-on delivery actions alongside the team to directly improve output, model best practices, and lift the standard of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Assurance:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct deep-dives into campaign performance and execution standards on key accounts, ensuring all work meets the agency’s benchmark for industry-leading influencer marketing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;2. Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Cross-Market Alignment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Relationship Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strong, collaborative relationships with the Heads of Campaign Delivery across all markets—initially focusing on the UK and US, before expanding into EMEA and APAC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Calibration:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze and evaluate how campaign delivery is handled by different market and team leads. Identify discrepancies in execution, share localized best practices, and drive a standardized &quot;one voice&quot; global approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure seamless collaboration and workflows between Organic Campaign Ops, Paid Media, Production, and Social Media Management teams on a global scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;3. New Business &amp;amp; Internal Collaboration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global New Business Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a key delivery expert for global new business pitches and proposals. This is not limited to the UK and US; you will support pitches across all regions where necessary, helping to define delivery strategies, scope out complex execution plans, and present to prospective clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Departmental Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with New Business, Account Management, and Product/Solutions teams to ensure delivery excellence and operational feasibility are at the forefront of new proposals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;4. Process Optimisation &amp;amp; Best Practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Efficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with the Head of Campaign Governance &amp;amp; Innovation, as well as ‘Heads of’ campaign delivery teams and Business Excellence teams to refine, implement, and police global workflows, processes, and tool utilization (including the agency platform, Ibex).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform and Tech Understanding:&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Be a resource in understanding the build out of Ibex, as well as any other tech and tools used across global markets. Analyse the benefits of tools used, and report back to the Global Leadership team where necessary about which tools are most effective. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge Sharing:&lt;/strong&gt; Bridge the gap between markets by facilitating knowledge-sharing sessions, ensuring that a success in the US/UK is effectively operationalised in APAC/EMEA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-the-Ground Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide direct mentoring and upskilling to campaign leads and managers when deployed on accounts, fostering a high-performance culture of continuous improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Required Skills:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience (typically 5+ years) in a senior delivery (organic/paid), campaign operations, or account director role within an influencer marketing, social media, or digital advertising agency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Disciplinary Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the entire campaign lifecycle spanning Organic Influencer Marketing, Paid Media/Programmatic, Video/Content Production, and Social Media Management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executional Capability:&lt;/strong&gt; A player-coach mentality. Whilst this is a senior director-level role, you must have the capability and willingness to execute tasks hands-on to support the team when required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience working within multi-regional structures; cultural awareness and the ability to influence and lead teams across different time zones and markets (UK, US, EMEA, APAC).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solving &amp;amp; Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptionally agile, resilient, and comfortable with ambiguity. Able to step into high-pressure situations, identify bottlenecks, and implement solutions quickly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship &amp;amp; Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong interpersonal and diplomatic skills. Ability to influence regional heads and senior stakeholders through relationship and trust building.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Analytical Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid understanding of campaign margins, resource utilization, and delivery KPIs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;  Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is within The Goat Agency, a leading brand within WPP Media, where you will help global brands harness the power of social and creator-led content to deliver measurable impact. Recognised as a global leader in the space, we deliver award-winning campaigns in more than 70 countries. With over 650 social natives worldwide, we create ambitious influencer programmes—from tactical activations to long-term partnerships—designed to drive awareness, engagement and conversions across the full marketing funnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working within the Intelligence and Insights team, you will support the development of clear, relevant and actionable insights that inform campaign planning and strategy. You will explore consumer behaviour, social conversations, creator activity, competitor performance and cultural trends, turning your findings into compelling stories and practical recommendations. This is an early-career opportunity suited to someone with one to two years of marketing, research, social media or insights experience who is curious about audiences, brands and culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insight Generation &amp;amp; Analysis:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct research into consumer behaviour, social media conversations, creator activity, competitor campaigns and emerging cultural trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review campaign results and relevant performance indicators to identify key themes, patterns and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring together information from multiple sources and translate findings into clear, engaging insight stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of practical recommendations for campaign planning, creator strategy and content development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use social listening, audience intelligence and research platforms to gather relevant information, with guidance from senior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a high standard of accuracy and attention to detail across all research and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Project &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support defined intelligence and insights projects, from initial research and information gathering through to final delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage assigned tasks and deadlines, raising questions or potential issues with senior team members when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate effectively with strategy, planning, campaign and client teams to understand their intelligence needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate findings clearly and confidently to internal stakeholders, with support where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond positively to feedback and use it to strengthen future research and insight development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Best Practice:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build knowledge of influencer marketing, social platforms, creator culture and the wider media landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop confidence in research, insight generation and storytelling techniques through hands-on experience and team support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay informed about emerging platforms, consumer behaviours, cultural shifts and industry developments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute ideas, examples and useful resources that support the team’s shared knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow established research standards and best practices, including accurate sourcing and clear documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Intelligence &amp;amp; Research Operations:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct desk research using reliable sources to support campaign briefs, pitches, reports and strategic projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor social conversations, creator activity, competitor behaviour and category developments to identify relevant insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help produce regular intelligence outputs, including trend reports, competitor reviews, audience summaries and campaign learnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and organise information from internal and external sources, ensuring findings are clearly documented and easy to understand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the maintenance of campaign tracking documents, research libraries and shared intelligence resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure campaigns and relevant information are added promptly to internal platforms, following up with stakeholders when details are missing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Insight Development &amp;amp; Quality:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify meaningful themes and patterns within research, social conversations and campaign information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help turn observations into insights by explaining what is happening, why it matters and how brands could respond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sense-check findings to ensure conclusions are supported by appropriate evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Check sources, calculations, formatting and written outputs carefully before sharing work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ask thoughtful questions and seek guidance when information is incomplete, unclear or inconsistent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Platform &amp;amp; Application Knowledge:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop working knowledge of our core intelligence, campaign and reporting applications, including Benchmark Index, Performance Analyser and Deliverables Calculator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use social listening, audience intelligence and research tools to gather information and identify relevant trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidently use Excel or Google Sheets for organising information, completing basic analysis and producing clear summaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate our BI and internal reporting tools to access existing information and dashboards, with training and support provided.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share feedback on internal tools and processes to help improve usability and team efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with colleagues across Intelligence and Insights, Strategy, Campaigns and other relevant teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly and proactively to help ensure actions are completed and projects remain on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in team discussions and contribute a curious, audience-focused perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build effective working relationships by being dependable, collaborative and open to feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of personal development and actively build knowledge of the influencer marketing and social media landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Ideal Candidate:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One to two years of experience in marketing, consumer research, social media, influencer marketing, media, strategy or insights, preferably within an agency or brand environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong interest in consumer behaviour, social media, creators, culture and emerging trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and critical-thinking skills, with the ability to look beyond surface-level observations and consider why something matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some experience conducting desk research, competitor analysis, social listening or campaign reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to turn research and information into clear, concise and engaging stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good written and verbal communication skills, with a willingness to build confidence in presenting findings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational skills and attention to detail, with the ability to manage multiple tasks and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Excel or Google Sheets; experience with social listening, research or audience intelligence tools would be beneficial but is not essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, collaborative and solution-focused approach, with a willingness to ask questions and learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No advanced coding, scripting or complex data-modelling experience is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
